th in its offensive towards Leningrad. In 1943 it was redeployed in Italy where it fought for the remainder of the war. The 5th Gebirgs-Division surrendered to the US forces in May 1945.","LocalizedString":"The Gebirgs-Pionier 95 was a battalion sized unit of the 5th Gebirgs-Division that was formed in 1940 and specialized in mountain warfare. The division took part in the invasion of Greece and the island of Crete where it fought its most significant battle in May 1941. In 1942 the division was deployed to the Eastern Front where it joined Army Group North in its offensive towards Leningrad. In 1943 it was redeployed in Italy where it fought for the remainder of the war. The 5th Gebirgs-Division surrendered to the US forces in May 1945."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isReserved":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnStartofTurn"],"hasAlpine":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion02'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/StarterContent/Audio/Explosion02.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Germany/Invasion/t_gebirgsjager_3.t_gebirgsjager_3","SubPathString":""},"artist":"German WWII Postcard","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/GEBIRGS-PIONIER_95.GEBIRGS-PIONIER_95","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":365.0,"Y":512.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_unit_gebirger_pionier_95_photo","SourceString":"Soldiers of the 5th Gebirgs Division board a Ju 52 bound for Crete, 1941.","LocalizedString":"Soldiers of the 5th Gebirgs Division board a Ju 52 bound for Crete, 1941."},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_ExplosionInfantryS'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Niagara/NS_ExplosionInfantryS.46"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeLight_C'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/examples/GrenadePack/Blueprints/CameraShakeLi